                                "sense_id": "52673eb8-c98f-387b-a21b-9b6a29d2aa7d",
                                "text": "[…]cutting out valiantly from under the guns of a dozen rivals some stout buxom widow suited to his estate and to his medium years — one of those plumply mellow quadrigenarious bodies who especially appeal to the vigorous and well-salted emotion which with sailor-men stands for love[…]"
